  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of an Industrial Park and Business Incubator for Microenterprises in the District of Subtanjalla, Ica Region, Peru.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COPRODELI will develop a business incubator and dedicated industrial park that will provide production facilities, equipment, business services, training and technical assistance to 100 micro- and small enterprises in the Ica region that suffered recent earthquake damage.</narrative>
  </description>
